README - Gled build area
========================

This directory is the build area of Gled. See ../README.md for what Gled
is and how to build and run it, and INSTALL for the configure options.

configure finds the libsets in ../libsets, resolves their dependencies and
writes build_config, Makefile.config, make/make_config.inc and
build_env.sh. make then builds each libset in its own directory and links
its executables, libraries, macros, configuration and perl modules into
bin/, lib/, macros/, cfg/ and perllib/ here, and its demos into
demos/<LibSet>.

The other directories hold the build itself: make/ the make fragments,
libexec/ the code generators and install scripts, perllib/ their perl
modules, cfg/ the class templates of gled-create, and test/ the tests.
